---
import PageLayout from "@layouts/PageLayout.astro";
import Section from "@components/sections/Section.astro";
import Badge from "@components/astro-ui/Badge.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import { site } from "@/data/site";

import peptideImg from "@assets/images/site/peptide-therapy.jpg";
import heroTelehealthImg from "@assets/images/site/hero-telehealth.jpg";
---

<PageLayout
  title="Peptide Therapy"
  description="Evidence-based peptide therapy protocols for performance, recovery, and wellness. Velora HealthConnect provides medically supervised telehealth consultations with ongoing follow-up care across Australia."
>
  <!-- ===== HERO ===== -->
  <section class="relative pt-16 pb-12 md:pt-24 md:pb-16 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-[oklch(0.965_0.01_230)] via-white to-[oklch(0.96_0.015_175)]"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-10 right-0 w-[400px] h-[400px] bg-[oklch(0.92_0.04_175/0.2)] rounded-full blur-[100px]"></div>
    <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <Badge variant="secondary" class="mb-6 bg-[oklch(0.92_0.03_175)] text-[oklch(0.30_0.06_175)]">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 mr-1.5 inline-block" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9.75 3.104v5.714a2.25 2.25 0 01-.659 1.591L5 14.5M9.75 3.104c-.251.023-.501.05-.75.082m.75-.082a24.301 24.301 0 014.5 0m0 0v5.714c0 .597.237 1.17.659 1.591L19.8 15.3M14.25 3.104c.251.023.501.05.75.082M19.8 15.3l-1.57.393A9.065 9.065 0 0112 15a9.065 9.065 0 00-6.23.693L5 14.5m14.8.8l1.402 1.402c1.232 1.232.65 3.318-1.067 3.611A48.309 48.309 0 0112 21c-2.773 0-5.491-.235-8.135-.687-1.718-.293-2.3-2.379-1.067-3.61L5 14.5" /></svg>
        Peptide Therapy
      </Badge>
      <h1 class="font-heading text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-primary sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl mb-6">
        Evidence-based peptides,<br class="hidden sm:block" />
        <span class="text-accent">medically prescribed</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-lg text-muted-foreground md:text-xl leading-relaxed">
        Clinically supervised peptide therapy protocols for performance, recovery, anti-ageing, and general wellness. Proper medical oversight with genuine follow-up care at every step.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== OVERVIEW ===== -->
  <Section id="overview" padding="lg">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      <div>
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-accent uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">About Peptide Therapy</p>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-primary sm:text-4xl mb-6">
          What are peptides and how can they help?
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            Peptides are short chains of amino acids that act as signalling molecules in the body. They play key roles in processes like muscle growth, recovery, immune function, and cellular repair. When prescribed by a qualified medical practitioner, specific peptide therapies can support a range of health and wellness goals.
          </p>
          <p>
            At Velora HealthConnect, we take an evidence-based approach to peptide therapy. Every protocol is prescribed by an Australian-registered practitioner after a thorough clinical assessment, and every patient receives ongoing monitoring to ensure safety and effectiveness.
          </p>
          <p>
            We do not take a one-size-fits-all approach. Your peptide protocol is tailored to your individual health profile, goals, and response to treatment — and adjusted over time through regular follow-up appointments.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="relative">
        <div class="aspect-[4/3] rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl">
          <Image
            src={peptideImg}
            alt="Medical laboratory research supporting evidence-based peptide therapy"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
            width={600}
            height={450}
          />
        </div>
        <!-- Floating card -->
        <div class="absolute -bottom-4 -right-4 bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-xl ring-1 ring-black/5">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-accent/10 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-accent" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75m-3-7.036A11.959 11.959 0 013.598 6 11.99 11.99 0 003 9.749c0 5.592 3.824 10.29 9 11.623 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.31-.21-2.571-.598-3.751h-.152c-3.196 0-6.1-1.248-8.25-3.285z" /></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-heading font-bold text-primary text-sm">Evidence-Based</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">Clinically guided protocols</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <!-- ===== TREATMENT AREAS ===== -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-gradient-to-b from-[oklch(0.975_0.005_230/0.5)] to-white">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-14">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-accent uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Treatment Areas</p>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-primary sm:text-4xl mb-4">
          Peptide protocols for your goals
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-muted-foreground">
          Our prescribers work with you to determine the most appropriate peptide protocol based on your individual needs and health profile.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border p-6 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-accent/5 transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-accent/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-accent" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3.75 13.5l10.5-11.25L12 10.5h8.25L9.75 21.75 12 13.5H3.75z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-primary mb-2">Performance & Recovery</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Peptide protocols to support muscle recovery, exercise performance, and physical resilience. Ideal for active adults and fitness enthusiasts.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border p-6 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-accent/5 transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-accent/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-accent" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 18v-5.25m0 0a6.01 6.01 0 001.5-.189m-1.5.189a6.01 6.01 0 01-1.5-.189m3.75 7.478a12.06 12.06 0 01-4.5 0m3.75 2.383a14.406 14.406 0 01-3 0M14.25 18v-.192c0-.983.658-1.823 1.508-2.316a7.5 7.5 0 10-7.517 0c.85.493 1.509 1.333 1.509 2.316V18" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-primary mb-2">Anti-Ageing & Vitality</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Peptides that may support cellular health, skin quality, and overall vitality. Protocols designed for those seeking to optimise their wellness as they age.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border p-6 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-accent/5 transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-accent/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-accent" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21 8.25c0-2.485-2.099-4.5-4.688-4.5-1.935 0-3.597 1.126-4.312 2.733-.715-1.607-2.377-2.733-4.313-2.733C5.1 3.75 3 5.765 3 8.25c0 7.22 9 12 9 12s9-4.78 9-12z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-primary mb-2">General Wellness</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Broad wellness-focused peptide protocols to support immune function, sleep quality, and overall health. Tailored to your individual health goals.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border p-6 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-accent/5 transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-accent/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-accent" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15.362 5.214A8.252 8.252 0 0112 21 8.25 8.25 0 016.038 7.048 6.75 6.75 0 009 4.5a.75.75 0 01.75.75c0 2.123.815 4.05 2.148 5.404a8.265 8.265 0 003.464-5.44z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-primary mb-2">Muscle Building</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Peptide protocols that support muscle growth and body composition. Prescribed alongside appropriate training and nutrition guidance.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border p-6 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-accent/5 transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-accent/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-accent" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21.752 15.002A9.718 9.718 0 0118 15.75c-5.385 0-9.75-4.365-9.75-9.75 0-1.33.266-2.597.748-3.752A9.753 9.753 0 003 11.25C3 16.635 7.365 21 12.75 21a9.753 9.753 0 009.002-5.998z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-primary mb-2">Sleep & Recovery</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Peptides that may support improved sleep quality and faster recovery. Beneficial for those with demanding lifestyles or training schedules.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border p-6 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-accent/5 transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-accent/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-accent" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75m-3-7.036A11.959 11.959 0 013.598 6 11.99 11.99 0 003 9.749c0 5.592 3.824 10.29 9 11.623 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.31-.21-2.571-.598-3.751h-.152c-3.196 0-6.1-1.248-8.25-3.285z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-primary mb-2">Immune Support</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Peptide protocols that may support immune system function and resilience. Prescribed based on individual health assessment.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== WHY MEDICAL SUPERVISION ===== -->
  <Section id="supervision" padding="lg">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      <div class="order-2 lg:order-1 space-y-8">
        <div class="aspect-[16/9] rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl">
          <Image
            src={heroTelehealthImg}
            alt="Healthcare professional conducting a telehealth consultation"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
            width={600}
            height={338}
          />
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl border-2 border-accent/20 p-8 bg-accent/[0.03]">
          <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-primary mb-6">Why medical supervision matters:</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-4">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
              <span class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-primary">Proper clinical assessment</strong> — Peptides are not suitable for everyone. A qualified prescriber ensures you are a good candidate before starting treatment.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
              <span class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-primary">Correct dosing protocols</strong> — Dosages are calibrated based on your individual health profile and adjusted based on your response.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
              <span class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-primary">Quality-assured supply</strong> — Peptides are sourced from licensed Australian compounding pharmacies, ensuring purity and consistency.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
              <span class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-primary">Ongoing monitoring</strong> — Regular follow-ups ensure your treatment remains safe and effective over time.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
              <span class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-primary">Drug interaction checks</strong> — Your prescriber reviews all current medications to avoid contraindications.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="order-1 lg:order-2">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-accent uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Safety First</p>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-primary sm:text-4xl mb-6">
          Why peptides should always be medically supervised
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-6">
          The internet is full of unregulated peptide products and unqualified advice. Unsupervised peptide use carries real risks — from incorrect dosing and contaminated products to dangerous interactions with existing medications.
        </p>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          At Velora HealthConnect, every peptide protocol is prescribed by an AHPRA-registered practitioner, sourced from licensed pharmacies, and monitored through regular follow-up appointments. This is the safe, responsible way to explore peptide therapy.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <!-- ===== HOW IT WORKS ===== -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-gradient-to-b from-[oklch(0.975_0.005_230/0.5)] to-white">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-14">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-accent uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">The Process</p>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-primary sm:text-4xl mb-4">
          How it works
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-muted-foreground">
          From your first enquiry through to ongoing monitoring — four straightforward steps.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 lg:gap-0">
        <div class="relative text-center lg:px-6">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-white border-2 border-accent/20 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5 shadow-sm relative z-10">
            <span class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-accent">1</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-primary mb-2">Submit Your Enquiry</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Tell us about your health goals, current medications, and what you are looking to achieve with peptide therapy.
          </p>
          <div class="hidden lg:block absolute top-8 left-[calc(50%+2.5rem)] w-[calc(100%-5rem)] h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-accent/30 via-accent/15 to-accent/30"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="relative text-center lg:px-6">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-white border-2 border-accent/20 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5 shadow-sm relative z-10">
            <span class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-accent">2</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-primary mb-2">Clinical Assessment</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            A thorough consultation with an Australian-registered prescriber to assess suitability and design your protocol.
          </p>
          <div class="hidden lg:block absolute top-8 left-[calc(50%+2.5rem)] w-[calc(100%-5rem)] h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-accent/30 via-accent/15 to-accent/30"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="relative text-center lg:px-6">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-white border-2 border-accent/20 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5 shadow-sm relative z-10">
            <span class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-accent">3</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-primary mb-2">Begin Your Protocol</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Your peptides are sourced from a licensed pharmacy and delivered with full administration guidance.
          </p>
          <div class="hidden lg:block absolute top-8 left-[calc(50%+2.5rem)] w-[calc(100%-5rem)] h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-accent/30 via-accent/15 to-accent/30"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="relative text-center lg:px-6">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-accent flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5 shadow-lg shadow-accent/20 relative z-10">
            <span class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-white">4</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-primary mb-2">Ongoing Monitoring</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Regular follow-ups to track your response, adjust dosing, and ensure ongoing safety and effectiveness.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== FAQ ===== -->
  <Section id="faq" padding="lg">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center mb-14">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-accent uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">FAQs</p>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-primary sm:text-4xl mb-4">
          Peptide therapy questions
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-4">
        <details class="group rounded-2xl border border-border overflow-hidden hover:border-accent/20 transition-colors">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer list-none">
            <h3 class="font-heading font-semibold text-primary pr-4">Are peptides safe?</h3>
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-muted-foreground flex-shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" /></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="px-6 pb-6 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            When prescribed by a qualified medical practitioner, sourced from licensed pharmacies, and monitored through regular follow-ups, peptide therapy has a well-established safety profile. This is why medical supervision is essential — it ensures correct dosing, quality products, and ongoing monitoring of your response.
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="group rounded-2xl border border-border overflow-hidden hover:border-accent/20 transition-colors">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer list-none">
            <h3 class="font-heading font-semibold text-primary pr-4">How are peptides administered?</h3>
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-muted-foreground flex-shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" /></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="px-6 pb-6 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Administration methods vary depending on the specific peptide prescribed. Your prescriber will explain exactly how to administer your treatment and provide detailed instructions. Our support team is also available to answer any questions about administration.
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="group rounded-2xl border border-border overflow-hidden hover:border-accent/20 transition-colors">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer list-none">
            <h3 class="font-heading font-semibold text-primary pr-4">How long before I see results?</h3>
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-muted-foreground flex-shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" /></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="px-6 pb-6 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Response times vary based on the specific peptide, the treatment goal, and individual factors. Some patients report noticing changes within the first few weeks, while others may take longer. Your prescriber will set realistic expectations during your initial consultation and track your progress through regular follow-ups.
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="group rounded-2xl border border-border overflow-hidden hover:border-accent/20 transition-colors">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer list-none">
            <h3 class="font-heading font-semibold text-primary pr-4">Can I use peptides alongside other medications?</h3>
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-muted-foreground flex-shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" /></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="px-6 pb-6 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
